msgid ""
"Navbatdan tashqari (jazo) naryadi: faol zalyotchik faqat 1-NO‘J yoki "
"1-Yotoqxonada posbon bo‘lib turadi, shu joy guruhi bitta kam kishi beradi. "
"Jazo naryadi sutka tasdiqlanganda “o‘tildi” hisoblanadi va adolat hisobiga "
"kirmaydi."
msgstr ""
"Extra duty (out of turn): an active offender serves only as an orderly at "
"Checkpoint 1 or Dormitory 1, and that post's group provides one person "
"fewer. An extra duty counts as served once the duty day is approved and is "
"not included in fairness."

msgid "Zalyot kiritish"
msgstr "Add penalty"

msgid ""
"Faqat o‘g‘il, faol va naryaddan ozod bo‘lmagan kursant. Faol zalyoti bor "
"kursantga yangisi qo‘shilsa, soni mavjudiga qo‘shiladi."
msgstr ""
"Only a male cadet who is active and not exempt from duty. If the cadet "
"already has an active penalty, the new extra duties are added to it."

